  <dialog class="company-modal" id="modal-amazon">
    <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <h3>Amazon</h3>
    <p class="modal-sub">2020–Present · Senior Product Manager, Energy &amp; Sustainability (Jan 2025–Present)<br />Product Manager, Finance (New Product Innovation) (Oct 2022–Jan 2025)<br />Senior Product Analyst, Finance (June 2020–Oct 2022)</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built and operate an LLM-orchestrated, deterministic content pipeline (Python, Figma via MCP): 28 of 28 fact sheets across 14 programs cleared legal, PR, and GTM review with zero corrections in 2026. Code computes every number from assured data, and a fail-closed QA gate blocks publish on any failed check.</li>
      <li>Cut per-program production time 51% (hitting the 50% goal) and the production budget by over 90%, eliminating the need for a ~$110K/yr design-platform contract and seasonal temp staffing. Architected for 14 marketplaces and 32 locales, with 2026 scoped to US English and Spanish to prove quality first.</li>
      <li>Authored PRDs and BRDs for AI products — requirements, workflows, edge cases, and evaluation criteria.</li>
      <li>Shaped $1B+ of 0-to-1 investment decisions across 5 product lines and 15+ new businesses; drove ambitious bets (indoor agriculture, EV charging, home energy hardware) to CEO-level review.</li>
      <li>Owned the business model, cost structure, and revenue-share recommendation for a $300MM+ co-development partnership with a third-party company; re-modeled scenarios through multiple redline rounds, and my recommended rev-share structure was adopted in the final agreement.</li>
      <li>Turned sustainability into a sales differentiator for Amazon Leo's enterprise and government pursuits, where buyers often require it: built the pitch narrative used in closed-door negotiations and at AWS re:Invent, and prepared sales teams for buyer questions. Built eero's carrier-facing equivalent, updated as product features changed.</li>
      <li>Sole finance &amp; GTM partner to "Build It," a ~20-person team testing how lean a hardware team can be and still ship: 3 consumer-electronics products from concept to launch; co-authored the PR/FAQ for Echo custom silicon (AZ3 / AZ3 Pro).</li>
    </ul>
  </dialog>

  <dialog class="company-modal" id="modal-heineken">
    <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <h3>Heineken USA</h3>
    <p class="modal-sub">2018–2020 · Senior Strategy Manager, Revenue Management</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built Python and Power BI automation that replaced manual reporting and rapidly generated sales decks for commercial teams.</li>
      <li>Reporting to the CFO, generated ~$30MM in organic sales growth across brands (Heineken, Dos Equis, Tecate) and major distributors nationwide.</li>
